$cats['Colour Realism']['Colour Realism Color So Real You Can Feel It'] = @('Two wet cherries hang from one stem rendered so realistically that the deep-red skin appears translucent around the highlights. Tiny condensation droplets magnify the cherry surface beneath them while reflected window light creates cool blue-white highlights','An iridescent beetle appears almost physically attached to the skin. Its shell moves through emerald turquoise cobalt and violet according to the direction of the imagined light rather than through decorative rainbow coloring','One hyperreal human eye fills the composition. Warm natural skin surrounds an intensely blue-green iris containing tiny amber structures and a believable window reflection across the cornea','A kingfisher sits immediately before taking flight. Electric cobalt and turquoise feathers contrast naturally with the birds burnt-orange chest while tiny feather structures remain believable rather than illustrated','A blood orange cut in half is illuminated from behind so light passes through the translucent flesh. Individual juice sacs glow ruby crimson and orange while the white pith remains subtly warm rather than pure white','A tiny glass perfume bottle contains pale amber liquid and one partially submerged pink flower. Refraction bends the flower stem where it passes through glass and liquid','A tropical fish swims through clear blue water. Turquoise light ripples across its orange and yellow scales while the underside receives deep cobalt reflected color','A ripe strawberry appears freshly washed with natural red variation tiny yellow-green seeds and several transparent droplets magnifying the fruit beneath them','A hummingbird hovers beside a crimson flower. Its iridescent throat shifts naturally between emerald turquoise and violet while red reflected light from the flower subtly enters the birds underside','A pale pink peony is backlit so several thin petals visibly transmit warm sunlight. Deeper petals move through coral burgundy and violet shadow without requiring black outlines')
$cats['Colour Realism']['Colour Realism Human Face and Skin'] = @('A womans face turns toward warm late-afternoon sunlight. One side glows through natural peach amber and gold skin tones while the shadow side receives subtle blue reflected light from the surrounding sky','A mans face is illuminated simultaneously by turquoise neon from one side and deep-red neon from the other. The colors mix naturally across the nose lips and cheek rather than dividing the portrait into two artificial halves','A freckled womans face is cropped closely around one eye nose and lips. Natural skin variation freckles moisture on the lips and reflected outdoor light make the portrait feel physically present','An elderly mans face is illuminated by warm window light. Age spots wrinkles grey-blue eyes and subtle red and violet skin tones are treated as beautiful evidence of life rather than airbrushed away','A womans face is partly underwater. The waterline crosses her eyes and refracts the upper portion of her face while moving bands of turquoise sunlight travel across her skin','A mans profile is illuminated by orange firelight. Warm light touches the forehead nose and lips while the opposite side receives subtle deep-blue night color','A woman looks upward beneath rain. Individual droplets cling to eyelashes and skin while city lights create small pink blue and gold reflections inside the wet surface','A dark-skinned woman is illuminated by warm golden sunlight with cool turquoise reflected light beneath the jaw and along one cheek. Skin is rendered through rich temperature variation rather than one uniform brown','A mans eye and surrounding face are reflected through cracked glass. Each shard contains the same realistic subject but catches slightly different environmental colors and angles','A womans portrait emerges from a dark environment while one intense red light illuminates her lips cheek and fingertips. Most surrounding colors remain restrained so the red becomes emotionally dominant')
$cats['Colour Realism']['Colour Realism Animals Alive In Color'] = @('A tiger steps through shallow blue water at sunset. Warm orange fur receives violet-blue reflections from below while ripples distort the reflection beneath the animal','A scarlet macaw turns its head toward the viewer. Individual red feathers move through crimson coral and orange while cobalt wing feathers catch turquoise reflected sky','A snow leopard stands against a cool mountain atmosphere. Its pale fur carries blue-grey environmental reflections while its green eyes become the controlled color focus','A fox stands in warm autumn light surrounded by softly blurred foliage. Orange fur contains gold rust burgundy and cool reflected shadows rather than flat orange','A peacock turns across the shoulder with iridescent cobalt emerald and turquoise feathers changing color according to surface angle','A black panther moves through dense green foliage after rain. Wet black fur reflects emerald leaves blue sky and tiny warm highlights rather than becoming a featureless dark mass','A flamingo stands in shallow sunset water. Pink feathers receive orange sunlight while lavender and blue reflections enter the shaded underside','A wolf stands beneath cold moonlight with subtle blue and violet environmental color moving through grey fur. Amber eyes provide the only warm focal color','A sea turtle swims beneath clear turquoise water. Sun caustics ripple across the shell while deeper parts shift naturally toward blue-green','A kingfisher strikes the surface of water at the exact instant of impact. Orange and cobalt feathers remain sharply realistic while turquoise water explodes around the bird')
$cats['Colour Realism']['Colour Realism Flowers Fruit and Natural Color'] = @('A deep-red rose is covered with morning dew. Burgundy shadows create depth while several transparent droplets magnify the petal texture beneath them','A sliced lemon and its leaves are illuminated by strong Mediterranean sunlight. Translucent yellow flesh glows while green reflected light subtly enters the white pith','A blue hydrangea cluster moves through cobalt violet and soft turquoise according to light and petal depth','A ripe peach has been sliced open revealing warm coral flesh deep-red center and realistic velvet skin catching soft light','A sunflower turns toward intense late-afternoon light. Golden petals glow against deep burgundy center shadows while green reflected color enters the underside','A cluster of dark grapes appears nearly translucent where strong light passes through individual fruit. Deep violet moves into ruby and warm amber at the illuminated edges','A bird-of-paradise flower explodes through orange cobalt and violet while maintaining completely believable botanical structure and surface texture','Several cherries sit inside a shallow glass bowl. The bowl distorts stems and fruit beneath the glass while red reflections bounce onto the surrounding surface','A magnolia is illuminated from behind. Cream petals remain mostly natural and restrained while translucent edges glow warm pink and peach','A pomegranate has split open exposing jewel-like ruby seeds surrounded by cream membrane and deep-red skin. Moisture creates tiny reflected highlights throughout')
$cats['Colour Realism']['Colour Realism Water Glass and Reflection'] = @('A womans eye is seen through a clear droplet of water causing the iris to enlarge and distort naturally through refraction','A clear glass sphere sits visually against the skin and contains an upside-down landscape refracted through it. Blue sky green trees and orange sunset bend according to the curvature of the glass','A koi swims immediately beneath rippling water. Orange scales distort through the moving surface while cobalt and turquoise reflections cross the fish','A realistic face appears behind rain-covered glass. Droplets remain sharply focused while the face and colored city lights beyond them soften naturally through depth of field','A transparent perfume bottle refracts a red rose placed behind it bending the stem and breaking the flower into distorted fragments of crimson','A chrome motorcycle helmet reflects an entire California sunset across its curved surface with orange sky blue ocean and dark palms bending around the helmet','A jellyfish floats through deep cobalt water. Its translucent body allows turquoise and violet environmental color to pass visibly through it','A hand reaches beneath clear water. Refraction shifts the fingers at the waterline while moving bands of cyan sunlight travel across the submerged skin','A crystal prism catches white sunlight and projects a restrained spectrum across the surrounding skin and nearby realistic flower','A realistic breaking wave wraps partially around the shoulder. Cobalt depth turquoise transparency white natural-skin foam and warm reflected sunset color create believable water rather than an illustrated wave')
