$cats['Colour Realism']['Colour Realism The Real World Made Surreal'] = @('A realistic womans face opens at the temple into a believable blue sky filled with clouds. Skin edges remain physically convincing as though the impossible opening actually exists','A tiger walks through shallow water while its stripes progressively transform into reflected sunset clouds without losing realistic fur texture','A realistic hummingbird approaches a flower whose petals gradually become transparent glass. The birds colors refract through the flower','A mans eye reflects a complete neon city inside the wet cornea with tiny cyan magenta and amber lights following the curvature of the eye','A womans hair becomes realistic ocean water as it leaves her head. Individual strands gradually turn into translucent cobalt waves rather than abruptly changing materials','A red fox stands in a forest where the trees above gradually become vertical streaks of northern lights. Both animal and environment remain realistically rendered','A realistic astronaut floats against deep space while the visor reflects Earth orange sunrise and the white spacecraft simultaneously','A realistic blue butterfly appears to emerge from the iris of a human eye. Both subjects share the same cobalt and turquoise light so the impossible scene feels physically coherent','A marble statue gradually develops believable living skin warm blood tone and a blue eye as the composition travels from bottom to top','A womans portrait contains a realistic sunset landscape visible through portions of her face as though her skin were transparent glass')
